    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>1级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +0</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 15，''强韧'' 13，''反射'' 13，''意志'' 10</span><span>''侦查'' -1</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，攀爬 6，掘穴 2（坑道）</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉，震动感知 10</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">巢穴工蚁狂怒（（自由动作，当该巢穴工蚁 10 格内的任何巨蚁生命值降到 0 时；随意））</div>\n<div class=description>该巢穴工蚁快步两格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+6 vs. AC<br>命中：4 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 17（+3）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+2）</span><span>''感知'' 9（-1）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 14（+2）</span><span>''智力'' 2（-4）</span><span>''魅力'' 4（-3）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
